  rd_l2_h1_hl: { en: "paid order.", fil: "bayad na order.", zh: "已付款的订单。", "zh-TW": "已付款的訂單。", vi: "đơn hàng đã thanh toán.", th: "ออเดอร์ที่ชำระแล้ว", id: "pesanan berbayar." },
  rd_l2_hero_sub: { en: "SellerFlowLive captures \"mine\" claims from your live automatically, gives every buyer a number, builds the order slip, and prints it — so you sell, not scribble.", fil: "Awtomatikong hinuhuli ng SellerFlowLive ang mga \"mine\" sa live mo, binibigyan ng number ang bawat buyer, binubuo ang order slip, at pini-print ito — para magbenta ka, hindi magsulat.", zh: "SellerFlowLive 自动捕捉直播中的“+1”，为每位买家编号、生成订单小票并打印——你只管卖，不用手写。", "zh-TW": "SellerFlowLive 自動擷取直播中的「+1」，為每位買家編號、產生訂單小票並列印——你只管賣，不用手寫。", vi: "SellerFlowLive tự động bắt các lượt \"mine\" trong live, đánh số từng người mua, tạo phiếu đơn hàng và in ra — bạn chỉ việc bán, không phải ghi chép.", th: "SellerFlowLive จับคำว่า \"mine\" จากไลฟ์ของคุณโดยอัตโนมัติ ให้หมายเลขผู้ซื้อ สร้างสลิปออเดอร์ และพิมพ์ออกมา — คุณแค่ขาย ไม่ต้องจด", id: "SellerFlowLive menangkap klaim \"mine\" dari live Anda secara otomatis, memberi nomor setiap pembeli, membuat slip pesanan, dan mencetaknya — Anda fokus jualan, bukan mencatat." },
